[h1]I've made a few updates recently. Here is what I have done[/h1]
1. full english translation;
2. Support leisure play. Some players complained to me about the high difficulty of the game, so I developed this mode. When you fail to challenge the Boss twice in a row, you can enable this option. You won't die in leisure mode;
3. Weaken some enemies;
4. Fix archive function bug;
As above. We sincerely invite you to experience the demo. Thank you. Have a nice day
